  <Class>EC.02.05.01</Class>
  <Text>The negative pressure for an isolation room on 5B 199 did not activate when the doors were closed.
Recommended Action(s)
  - These rooms must be evaluated on a regular basis to ensure they are ready for use when needed.
  - Engineering must notify nursing if a room is out of service due to air flow.
</Text>
